{"name": "TileShire", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/eb985ba0de16cc6516fe9c1076fc58a1.webp?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/6084820f289047f05cc715be916f8a57.poster.avif?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/6084820f289047f05cc715be916f8a57.webm?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/6084820f289047f05cc715be916f8a57.mp4?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you score, the more you can explore. Expand your village and discover what's just beyond the horizon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/6a0b24f89d0ceb98566ca1f934611829.webp?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/c764f725324a6ab60a73adf57be248cd.poster.avif?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/c764f725324a6ab60a73adf57be248cd.webm?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/c764f725324a6ab60a73adf57be248cd.mp4?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with combinations to craft new tiles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/3be40457ba02538d490e15c873ebcc53.webp?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/de9bc890fbdc2df4af4bb9803b082a68.poster.avif?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/de9bc890fbdc2df4af4bb9803b082a68.webm?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/de9bc890fbdc2df4af4bb9803b082a68.mp4?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiles can react and proliferate across your shire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/7324a3eeefb94c8af7a61f1b74d3de76.webp?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/3b1938efe087fb38e3cc93a53ee05ac7.poster.avif?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/3b1938efe087fb38e3cc93a53ee05ac7.webm?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/3b1938efe087fb38e3cc93a53ee05ac7.mp4?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint your perfect picture and reap the score rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/cc30d6c2ed563584bc60123511d91f76.webp?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/0fb89faa2d4cbb3ff4a096698e0328a3.poster.avif?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/0fb89faa2d4cbb3ff4a096698e0328a3.webm?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/0fb89faa2d4cbb3ff4a096698e0328a3.mp4?t=1785184317\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Populate your shire with inhabitants that match your playstyle, and discover new synergies and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/d0753ffd7068b77fc5584ccba9c0525b.webp?t=1785184317\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Commemorate each shire you complete. Now there's a place I want to visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370780/extras/ca8dd30cf2817568570e954e2667a9d9.avif?t=1785184317\" width=\"128\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><